  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A person moved from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> on a circular path as shown in figure. If the distance travelled by him is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>, then the magnitude of displacement would be : (Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mn>135</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></math>)</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0045_e8cf849e90e1.jpg\" style=\"width: 130px; height: 118px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>42</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>47</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>19</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0045_e8cf849e90e1.jpg\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 109px;\" /></p><p>The distance travelled by the person&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;will be equal to the arch length.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>80</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Now the magnitude of displacement can be found using subtraction of vectors. Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>s</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>s</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>135</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>80</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>47</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
